 "_notes": [
  "AWS standard partition: all 34 Regions in the 'Available AWS Regions' table (2026-09-29).",
  "AWS ISO/ISO-B/ISO-E/ISO-F (classified) partitions are omitted: their locations are not published.",
  "GCP: every region in the Compute Engine regions and zones table (43). Country is taken from the zone location column; 'England' is recorded as GB.",
  "Azure: every region in the public 'List of Azure regions' table (57), plus Azure Government and Azure operated by 21Vianet regions. 'access: restricted' marks regions Microsoft lists as restricted-access. Azure 'East Asia' is Hong Kong (HK); 'Southeast Asia' is Singapore.",
  "Hong Kong is recorded as HK (its own ISO 3166-1 code). For 28 CFR Part 202 purposes, 'China' includes Hong Kong and Macau (28 CFR 202.208); residency.py applies that separately."
 ],
